<title>DUBAI: Iran, Oman sign pact to halt dual air links taxation.</title>
<headline>Iran, Oman sign pact to halt dual air links taxation.</headline>
<dateline>DUBAI 1997-01-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Oman and Iran have signed an agreement to prevent dual taxation on revenue from bilateral air transport, the official Iranian News Agency said on Sunday.</p>
<p>The accord was signed in Muscat late on Saturday.</p>
</text>
